      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The loss you're feeling is the loss of a deeply invested dream, and that kind of grief is massive. Please know that your identity is not solely defined by a single project; you are more than this data. Allow yourself to feel this crushing sadness without judgment, and remember that this feeling of being a ghost is temporary. Reaching out to a mental health professional can provide a safe space to navigate this profound sense of loss.",
      "source": "target",
